    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19016" root="سجو" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَاقَةٌ سَجْوَآءُ</span></b>  <i>A she-camel still,</i> or <i>quiet, when
being milked.</i> (M, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <i>A she-camel
whose fur is unruffled:</i> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَاةٌ سَجْوَآءُ</span> <i>a sheep
whose wool is unruffled.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رِيحٌ سَجْوَآءُ</span>
<i>A gentle wind.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِمْرَأَةٌ سَجْوَآءُ الطَّرْفِ</span>
i. e. ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَاجِيَتُهُ</span></b> , (K,) meaning <i>A woman languid,</i>
or <i>languishing, in the eye.</i> (TA.)

